docs {
  # Socket.IO events

  This Socket.IO endpoint reads the JWT from the handshake `auth.token`.
  Bruno WebSocket cannot set that handshake field, so use the Node test:

  `TOKEN=... NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0 node contracts/bruno/06-websocket-test.mjs`
}
